secubox-lyrion (1.1.1-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * fix(slimproto): DNAT was bound to a hardcoded "lan0" interface, which
    is DOWN on a SecuBox deployed behind another router (e.g. gk2 behind a
    Freebox, where LAN clients arrive on the uplink eth2). Result: 0
    players could reach the LMS — the prerouting rule never matched.
    install-lxc.sh ensure_slimproto_dnat() now generates an
    interface-agnostic rule (iifname != br-lxc) so it matches players on
    any LAN/Wi-Fi/uplink interface; SECUBOX_LAN_IFACE still pins a single
    interface when set. Forward chain is policy accept and conntrack
    rewrites the reply (LXC gateway = host), so DNAT alone suffices.
    NOTE: hardware players may still need the Wi-Fi AP bridged or a manual
    LMS-server IP — LMS advertises its LXC IP (10.100.0.100) for streaming,
    which is not L2-reachable from the LAN; the DNAT only fixes slimproto
    control reachability.

 -- Gerald KERMA <devel@cybermind.fr>  Mon, 29 Jun 2026 12:00:00 +0200

secubox-lyrion (1.1.0-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * /lyrion/ on the canonical hub vhost is now a SecuBox admin webui,
    NOT a reverse proxy to the LMS Material UI. The previous proxy_pass
    to 10.100.0.100:9000 broke every LMS asset URL (/material/customcss,
    /cometd/handshake, /css/...) because LMS hardcodes absolute paths
    that lose the /lyrion/ prefix. The real music player still lives at
    its own vhost lyrion.gk2.secubox.in where LMS serves at the root
    and Material loads correctly — the admin page links to it via a
    prominent "Open Lyrion Music UI" button.

  * www/lyrion/index.html rewritten as a SecuBox admin panel: status
    pill (green/yellow/red), components, access endpoints, now-playing
    track, connected-players table, and a "Rescan library" action.
    Polls every 15 s. No more iframe to /lyrion/d/... (which never had
    a backend anyway).

  * api/main.py: /players, /now-playing and /rescan are no longer stubs.
    They hit LMS's JSON-RPC endpoint inside the LXC (slim.request) via
    urllib — keeping the package dep set minimal. /now-playing scans
    all powered-on players for the first one in play mode. /rescan
    triggers an LMS scan that runs in the background.

  * nginx/lyrion.conf rewritten: /lyrion/ is `alias /usr/share/secubox/
    www/lyrion/` (static admin page) instead of `proxy_pass LMS`. Both
    /api/v1/lyrion/ and /lyrion/ are gated by auth_request /__sbx_auth_
    verify so the SecuBox SSO covers admin access.

